e; reset 15 s after the last aura ends) plus one roll checked against cumulative bands (miss, then resist, then hit).","decision":"adapt","decision_why":"Keep the ladder numbers and the single-roll bands. Change the source rule: the donor advances the ladder only for player-controlled casters and skips world bosses (Spell.cpp 3198-3211); Frankendom rules one CC ladder for any source. Also fix the pushback counter, which is spent before the zero-push check (Spell.h 654-657).","decision_status":"proposed","acceptance":"Server test: an NPC stun then a second stun from another source on the same target within 15 s gives 50% duration; a third gives 25%; a fourth applies no aura; after 15 s with no active stun on that group the next stun is full length."}
